{"3141330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Of Lies and Rain", "steam_appid": 3141330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of Lies and Rain is a story-driven first-person shooter built exclusively for VR. Set in a dark, sci-fi, post-apocalyptic world, you’ll fight to reclaim your past and save humanity from the brink of extinction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>September 10, 2048</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world you once knew is gone, and so is your memory. An unfamiliar voice urges you to defeat A.D.E., the AI behind the long lasting 20-year war that has driven humanity into hiding beneath the Earth. The surface is now ruled by hostile machines, new lifeforms fighting for their survival. Just like everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To defeat A.D.E., you must wield your powers. Abilities that grant access to a new plane of reality: Worlds within technology, within a world shattered by it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a dystopian tale where nothing is as it seems, and the line between friend and foe has never been so thin. Battle through a ravaged world to save what remains of humanity’s future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the truth</strong> behind the world’s destruction and those responsible for humanity’s downfall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the life of a survivor</strong> through memories hidden throughout the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traverse interconnected real and digital worlds</strong>, blurring the lines between biological and digital consciousness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight your way through a ruined world</strong>, fending off hostile machines—each with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield weapons with distinct and innovative designs</strong>, each crafted to offer a unique combat experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve the riddles blocking your path</strong> and push forward to meet your destiny.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of Lies and Rain is a story-driven first-person shooter built exclusively for VR. Set in a dark, sci-fi, post-apocalyptic world, you’ll fight to reclaim your past and save humanity from the brink of extinction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>September 10, 2048</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world you once knew is gone, and so is your memory. An unfamiliar voice urges you to defeat A.D.E., the AI behind the long lasting 20-year war that has driven humanity into hiding beneath the Earth. The surface is now ruled by hostile machines, new lifeforms fighting for their survival. Just like everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To defeat A.D.E., you must wield your powers. Abilities that grant access to a new plane of reality: Worlds within technology, within a world shattered by it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a dystopian tale where nothing is as it seems, and the line between friend and foe has never been so thin. Battle through a ravaged world to save what remains of humanity’s future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the truth</strong> behind the world’s destruction and those responsible for humanity’s downfall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the life of a survivor</strong> through memories hidden throughout the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traverse interconnected real and digital worlds</strong>, blurring the lines between biological and digital consciousness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight your way through a ruined world</strong>, fending off hostile machines—each with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield weapons with distinct and innovative designs</strong>, each crafted to offer a unique combat experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve the riddles blocking your path</strong> and push forward to meet your destiny.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Of Lies and Rain is a story-driven first person shooter built exclusively for VR. Set in a dark, sci-fi, post-apocalyptic world, at the edge of the real and digital realm. You’ll fight to reclaim your past and save humanity from the brink of extinction.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“the VR game we deserve”<br>Frontways Larry<br><br>“Memorable 10+ hour game”<br>9.2 – PSVR2 Without Parole<br><br>“the next Half Life VR?”<br>Beardo Benjo<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141330/header.jpg?t=1773925161", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141330/0bf4772c4db40f6cbb7acc91507112b2308c43be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773925161", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141330/0bf4772c4db40f6cbb7acc91507112b2308c43be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773925161", "website": "https://www.castelloinc.it/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 